fierce-ng (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * DNS engine: A/AAAA/MX/NS/TXT/CAA/SRV, wildcard, AXFR, dangling-CNAME.
  * Passive OSINT collectors: crt.sh (CT logs) and Shodan.
  * Stealth orchestrator: resolver rotation, jitter, QPS caps, error back-off.
  * ML predictor: character n-gram subdomain generation and ranking.
  * Graph & risk layer with 0-100 scoring and GraphML/Neo4j export.
  * Adaptive Recon Brain (passive/active/hybrid/auto).
  * Exporters: JSON/CSV/HTML, diff/alerts, signed run manifest.

